Krita Nova 81 - Right-click layer list for the Move tool and Select Shapes

The "Layers Under Cursor" list of patch 80 (the layers with content under
the cursor, top to bottom, the active one checked; picking one activates
it) is now KisToolUtils::novaAddLayersUnderCursor() and is also shown:
- by the Move tool, which had no right-click menu: right-click shows just
  the list (like Photoshop's Move tool); nothing when no layer is there;
- by the Select Shapes tool, above the Vector Shape Actions; on a layer
  without shapes (where the arrow makes pixel selections, patch 79) the
  selection actions follow instead of the vector shape actions.
Right-click reaches tools through the "Show Popup Widget" canvas input
action (right button in Krita's profiles).

